# 1. Anclaje y preparacion del Slab 0x1000: Agente 1 (Qwen / Logica Algebraica)
ROT_LIE_SO|DEST=0x1000|D=2048|A=0x1000|B=0x0000|DT=0.0100|ALPHA=1.00|GAMMA=0.05|THETA=0.0000|AGENT=3|TURING=12|SAGES=EULER

# 2. Anclaje y preparacion del Slab 0x2000: Agente 2 (DeepSeek-R1 / Razonamiento Formal)
ROT_LIE_SO|DEST=0x2000|D=2048|A=0x2000|B=0x0000|DT=0.0100|ALPHA=1.00|GAMMA=0.05|THETA=0.0000|AGENT=3|TURING=12|SAGES=LEIBNIZ

# 3. Anclaje y preparacion del Slab 0x2500: Agente 3 (Gemma / Manifold Relacional)
ROT_LIE_SO|DEST=0x2500|D=2048|A=0x2500|B=0x0000|DT=0.0100|ALPHA=1.00|GAMMA=0.05|THETA=0.0000|AGENT=3|TURING=12|SAGES=GAUSS

# 4. Entrelazamiento de Lie SO(D): Rotacion infinitesimal entre Agente 1 y Agente 2
ROT_LIE_SO|DEST=0x3000|D=2048|A=0x1000|B=0x2000|DT=0.0100|ALPHA=1.00|GAMMA=0.05|THETA=0.1571|AGENT=3|TURING=12|SAGES=EULER+LEIBNIZ

# 5. Deliberacion Dialectica de Lyapunov: Convergencia asintotica no-booleana (Turing=12 vueltas)
DIALECTIC_LYAPUNOV|DEST=0x3500|D=2048|A=0x3000|B=0x2500|DT=0.0100|ALPHA=1.20|GAMMA=0.08|THETA=0.0000|AGENT=3|TURING=12|SAGES=EULER+LEIBNIZ+GAUSS

# 6. Retraccion Polar de Stiefel Orden 4 con Acumulador Compensado Neumaier (Deriva <= 1e-15)
RETRACT_STIEFEL|DEST=0x3500|D=2048|A=0x3500|B=0x0000|DT=0.0100|ALPHA=1.00|GAMMA=0.05|THETA=0.0000|AGENT=3|TURING=12|SAGES=POINCARE

# 7. Telepatia PMTP Silicio Directo: Mapeo de Slab hacia ShmBus / Nodo ALADIN (192.168.100.21)
PMTP_TELEPATHY|DEST=0x4000|D=2048|A=0x3500|B=0x0000|DT=0.0100|ALPHA=1.00|GAMMA=0.05|THETA=0.0000|AGENT=3|TURING=12|SAGES=TURING

# 8. Colapso Efimero MMIO a 16.6 ms: Proyeccion a Framebuffer de frontera y destruccion en O(1)
COLLAPSE_MMIO|DEST=0x0000|D=2048|A=0x3500|B=0x0000|DT=0.0100|ALPHA=1.00|GAMMA=0.05|THETA=0.0000|AGENT=3|TURING=12|SAGES=NONE

# 9. Halt de Equilibrio Asintotico Certificado: Punto Fijo de Lyapunov
HALT_EQUILIBRIUM|DEST=0x3500|D=2048|A=0x0000|B=0x0000|DT=0.0100|ALPHA=1.00|GAMMA=0.05|THETA=0.0000|AGENT=3|TURING=12|SAGES=NONE
